            <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 00:39:03 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Menu bar reliability on multi-display Macs</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed a bug where the menu bar icon could become greyed out and completely unresponsive to clicks after moving focus between two displays. The menu bar is now built directly with AppKit instead of SwiftUI's MenuBarExtra, which this issue was specific to.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
