            <title>Version 1.0.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 21:55:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1.0.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Automatic updates</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>The app can now update itself — checks in the background, downloads, and installs and relaunches automatically. "Check for Updates…" in the menu bar still works for checking on demand.</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Licensing (1.0.1)</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Added a 30-day free trial. After that, a license file is required to keep running scheduled and manual backups.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
